      "description": "Ásdís Mbeki belongs to Accidental Constructivism and works in Studio 4, the old soap factory. Asked about influences, Ásdís Mbeki said only \"a sculpture made entirely of hesitation\". Primary Occupation: Conceptual artist; the best work is the absence of work.",
